#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:1
msgid "将量子采样器集成到 PyTorch"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:3
msgid ""
"README 中的基础示例表明，KPP 将 PyTorch 模型、优化器和 Kaiwu SDK "
"采样器组合在同一个训练循环中。本章说明如何将本地模拟退火替换为相干伊辛机（CIM）采样器，以及当前 KPP API 中各调用的含义。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:5
msgid "核心接口"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:7
msgid ""
"`RestrictedBoltzmannMachine` 和 `BoltzmannMachine` 均继承自 "
"`AbstractBoltzmannMachine`。训练中最常用的接口是："
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:9
msgid "`get_hidden(s_visible, ...)`：为 RBM 构造包含可见与隐藏状态的正相状态。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:10
msgid "`sample(sampler)`：根据当前模型参数构造 Ising 矩阵，调用 `sampler.solve()`，并返回负相状态张量。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:11
msgid "`objective(s_positive, s_negative)`：计算其梯度等价于负对数似然梯度的目标。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:13
msgid "因此，`sample()` 不接收数据状态，也不返回可见层和隐藏层两个张量；`objective()` 只接收正相与负相两个状态张量。"
msgstr ""

